docs {
  # Get File Transform
  
  **Method:** GET  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/api/v1/files/{{file_id}}/transforms/{key}`  
  **Permission:** `file:read` (+ `file:read_private` when effective access is private)
  
  `{key}` is a project preset (e.g. `thumbnail`) or legacy `size-{n}`.
  
  | Case | Expected |
  | --- | --- |
  | Public file + `read` | **200** |
  | Private file + `read` only (typical `public` role) | **403** |
  | Private file + `read` + `read_private` | **200** |
}
